{"id": 7215721742534, "title": "Breastmilk Storage Bags", "body_html": "<p><strong>TEMP-Sensing Discoloration</strong>: Help parents to keep track of milk temp at any time. Purple is Cold (＜36℃/96.8℉), blue is Optimum Feeding Temperature (36-40℃/96.8-104℉), and white is Hot (＞40℃/104℉).</p>\n<p><strong>Double Strong Sealing</strong>: Designed with double sealed side seams &amp; double zipper to protect and freeze breastmilk. When sealing, press your fingertips and make a sound. Presterilized &amp; BPA free thickened milk bag, safely build your milk bank.</p>\n<p><strong>Zero Contamination</strong>: Milk import/export separation design ensures that there is no contamination. Simply open the sealing strip when pouring milk, and cut along a cutting line when you need to breastfeeding. It's that easy!</p>\n<p><strong>Space-saving Design</strong>: Breast milk storage bags can be freezed super flat or upright. This unique feature also allows defrost or freeze milk quickly. Friendly Tips: Capacity is not exceed 6OZ. After milk is poured into the bag, it is necessary to release the air. After thawing, heat it to 40°C (104°F).</p>\n<p><strong>More Customers Options</strong>: Momcozy 200-Pack Breast Milk Storage Bags are the perfect pack size to support new parents' expressing and storing in their first few months!</p>", "vendor": "Momcozy", "product_type": "Accessories", "created_at": "2022-03-03T07:13:48-05:00", "handle": "breastmilk-storage-bags", "updated_at": "2026-10-13T03:55:03-04:00", "published_at": "2022-03-03T07:19:11-05:00", "template_suffix": "bp-milk-bags", "published_scope": "global", "tags": "Breastfeeding supplies, Top100_Sales, 储奶收集, 吸奶器, 吸奶器小品, 小品主链", "variants": [{"id": 42664596308166, "product_id": 7215721742534, "title": "50 count", "price": "9.99", "sku": "MS002-NA00NB-C", "position": 1, "compare_at_price": "9.99", "fulfillment_service": "manual", "inventory_management": null, "option1": "50 count", "option2": null, "option3": null, "created_at": "2023-